("common-eastern-firefly","life","Males fly and flash; females wait in the grass and answer with a flash of their own.",""),
("common-eastern-firefly","people","Its luciferase was among the first to be studied in labs, and the enzyme, along with the gene that makes it, is now a common research tool, used to make cells glow so scientists can detect bacteria, track genes and test drugs.",""),
